+*   **Precision**: Clamp $A$ to $1e-20$ and discriminant to $0.0$ in quadratic sphere intersection to avoid NaNs [S3, unofficial].
+*   **Boundaries**: Assert $t_{max} > t_{min}$ for all rays [S3, unofficial].
